{
  "tema": 5874,
  "slug": "recuerdo-me-acuerdo",
  "titulo": "Recordar, acordar and acordarse",
  "subtitulo": "Recuerdo tu nombre. Me acuerdo de ti.",
  "foto": "t03.jpg",
  "regla": "Recordar, acordar and acordarse are o > ue verbs: the o becomes ue in every present form except nosotros (recuerdo, recordamos; me acuerdo, nos acordamos). Recordar algo and acordarse de algo both mean to remember; acordar alone means to agree on.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "All three are **o → ue** stem-changing **-ar** verbs. The change happens in every present form **except nosotros**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "recordar",
            "acordarse"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "**recuerdo**",
              "me **acuerdo**"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "**recuerdas**",
              "te **acuerdas**"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "**recuerda**",
              "se **acuerda**"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "recordamos",
              "nos acordamos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos, ustedes",
              "**recuerdan**",
              "se **acuerdan**"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Recordar** + thing: _to remember_. No **de**: **recuerdo su nombre**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Acordarse de** + thing: _to remember_. Reflexive, and it needs **de**: **me acuerdo de su nombre**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Acordar** (not reflexive) means _to agree on, to decide together_: **acordamos vernos a las ocho**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "recordar algo",
            "=",
            "acordarse de algo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **acordarse** brings its own baggage, **me** and **de**. **Recordar** travels light."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "No ==recuerdo== dónde dejé las llaves.",
              "en": "I don't remember where I left the keys."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Te acuerdas de== la ola de ayer?",
              "en": "Do you remember yesterday's wave?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi abuela ==recuerda== todas las recetas de memoria.",
              "en": "My grandma remembers every recipe by heart."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Nos acordamos de== ti cada vez que pasamos por Rosarito.",
              "en": "We remember you every time we drive through Rosarito."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis alumnos nunca ==se acuerdan de== la técnica nueva.",
              "en": "My students never remember the new technique."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ustedes ==recuerdan== la primera temporada de _The Expanse_, ¿verdad?",
              "en": "You guys remember the first season of The Expanse, right?"
            },
            {
              "es": "El equipo y yo ==recordamos== bien ese torneo.",
              "en": "The team and I remember that tournament well."
            },
            {
              "es": "Los vecinos ==acuerdan== regar el huerto los lunes.",
              "en": "The neighbors agree to water the garden on Mondays."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
